[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2587669567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101465#issuecomment-2587669567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101465","id":2587669567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aPLQ_","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T16:57:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T16:57:54Z","body":"Thanks!\n\nThis issue seems to be the same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/issues/889, for which we made PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1458 for godot-cpp.\n\nDo you know if `DebugDraw3D` is using a version of godot-cpp that includes that fix? If not, then I think it'll be fixed when they update.\n\nIn any case, this is a really tricky problem, that took a lot of discussion to find an acceptable fix for. I really hope that it isn't back, and that it's just a matter of that GDExtension being on an old version of godot-cpp. :-)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2587669567/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644483214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101465#issuecomment-2644483214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101465","id":2644483214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dn5yO","user":{"login":"DmitriySalnikov","id":7782218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODIyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7782218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov","html_url":"https://github.com/DmitriySalnikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T03:58:30Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T03:58:30Z","body":"> Do you know if `DebugDraw3D` is using a version of godot-cpp that includes that fix?\n\nThe asset-library version still uses `godot-cpp` `4.1-cherrypicks-12` (latest 13).\nAnd this version seems to crash not only in 4.4, but also in 4.3.\n\nThe latest (not yet released) version of the library with `godot-cpp` `4.1-cherrypicks-13` does not crash for me.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.c